  "notes": [
   "Epoch split: 2020-11 (memoja) and 2021-06 (haedun33) show the OLD 3F layout — separate glazed shops (카페, 롯데리아, 빈티지38, 부산옥 etc.) along the mezzanine edge under the roof trusses, 2F concourse visible below, escalator arrival (haedun33_001).",
   "2022-08-16 wheelbusan board lists 3F tenants: 부산옥, EGG BOX, EDIYA COFFEE, 빈티지38, 북창동순두부, 자갈치뚝배기, 멘무샤; only one photo (부산옥 shopfront) is on that page.",
   "2023-01 (hna210, paning_) onward: the unified 코레일 푸드코트 with the lit \"푸드코트\" sign, counter row (북창동순두부, 육수당, 멘무샤...), kiosks, long window wall with harbour view, timber tables; 2024-2026 posts show the same space with minor changes (EDIYA/빈티지38 cafes on the right, Christmas tree 2026-02).",
   "shoobong_good 2025-05 includes the official 3F floor guide image (…_048.jpg) plus every 3F shopfront; ljsyou2128 2026-05 adds 부산옥/비빔가/food-court counters.",
   "No escalator-arrival photo was found for the post-2023 layout; haedun33 2021 has the only escalator arrival view."
